{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51396","headline":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 三 · 李绅","name":"莺莺歌（逸句〖1〗） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹诚寸之难自比，写在红笺方寸纸。\n寄与春风伴落花，彷佛随风绿杨里。\n窗中暗读人不知，剪破红绡裁作诗。\n还怕香风易飘荡，自令青鸟口衔之。\n诗中报郎含隐语，郎知暗到花深处。\n三五月明当户时，与郎相见花间路。\n（同上〖卷四〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}